*.jsonc   text
# -whitespace: two trailing spaces are a HARD LINE BREAK in Markdown, not an
# error. Without this, `git diff --check` reports every one of them, which
# failed pr.yml's "Detect merge conflict markers and whitespace errors" step
# on PR #11 with 59 findings across ADR-0003, ADR-0004 and nine handbooks --
# none of them a defect, and none introduced by the change under review.
# Verified in a scratch repository that this suppresses ONLY the whitespace
# half: a leftover conflict marker in a .md file is still reported and still
# exits 2. Conflict-marker detection is what that step exists for and it is
# unaffected.
*.md      text -whitespace
*.yml     text
*.yaml    text
*.xml     text
*.sql     text
*.sh      text eol=lf
*.ps1     text eol=crlf

